  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7006.03 Coordination with the Public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7006.03 Coordination with the Public. The bureau shall provide services which ensure that persons dialing 911 from any wired or wireless phone to request emergency firefighting, law enforcement, ambulance, medical, or rescue services receive prompt delivery of such services from local public or private providers.\n\nSource. #9091, eff 2-21-08 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 7000); ss by #11128, eff 6-29-16",
